            For most homes, the nVent Raychem FrostGuard is the best heat tape for pipes: self-regulating, overlap-safe and simple to install. Choose the HEATIT 24-foot for value, the HeatTapePro for its indicator light and warranty, the Wrap-On for the lowest wattage, the Frost King or EasyHeat for short, simple runs, and the HEATIT in-line cable for buried lines.
          </p>
